<title>UK: LIFFE certified coffee stocks rise to 1,591 lots.</title>
<headline>LIFFE certified coffee stocks rise to 1,591 lots.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>London International Financial Futures and Options Exchange (LIFFE) certified coffee stocks rose to 1,591 five-tonne lots in September from 929 lots in August, LIFFE said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Following is the breakdown of coffee stocks held in LIFFE warehouses at the end of September 1996 (five-tonne lots) -</p>
<p>    United Kingdom	  30</p>
<p>    Rotterdam		 59</p>
<p>    Amsterdam		  3</p>
<p>    Hamburg		   49</p>
<p>    Bremen		   122</p>
<p>    Antwerp		  335</p>
<p>    Le Havre		 374</p>
<p>    Barcelona		  2</p>
<p>    Trieste		   91</p>
<p>    New York		 101</p>
<p>    New Orleans	    425</p>
<p>    TOTAL		  1,591</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8072</p>
